# Testing
- Before commit: `npm run test:ci`. Test non-trivial logic (Arrange/Act/Assert). Fast, isolated.
- Before review: `npm run test:ci` + `coderabbit --prompt-only -t uncommitted`.
- Structure: describe/it blocks, descriptive names, one concept per test.
